{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55412","headline":"偈 · 志端","name":"偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"年来（一作「来年」）二月二，别汝暂相弃。\n爇（一作「烧」）灰散四林，勿（一作「免」）占檀那地。\n（见《景德传灯录》卷二十二。\n注一作者爲《五灯会元》卷八之异文。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"志端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55412.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55412","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}